{"type": "item.completed", "item": {"id": "item_4", "type": "command_execution", "command": "/bin/zsh -lc 'rtk read docs/index.md'", "aggregated_output": "---\nproduct: Webshop\ndocs-format: 1\n---\n# Webshop\n\n## What it is\nThis is a small webshop where customers buy outdoor gear. Customers send items back when they do not fit, and support handles returns and refunds.\n\n## Domains\n| Domain | Covers | Owner |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| returns | Customer returns and refunds | Sanne |\n\n## Behavior\nSee [behavior/](behavior/): one folder per domain, one file per capability, each a short list of claims with IDs.\n\n## Architecture\nSee [architecture/](architecture/): one file per area, `stack.md` first.\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
